tools.description:
Parses a JSON string into a list of dictionaries, where each dictionary contains the "id", "title", and "body" fields.
Formats the output as a string with the following format:

ID: {id}
Title: {title}
Body: {body}

ID: {id}
Title: {title}
Body: {body}

output_0.description:
